    {
      "title": "分層公式",
      "beats": [
        {
          "show": [
            "$f\\ge0$ 可測：",
            "$\\int_X f\\,d\\mu=\\int_0^\\infty\\mu(\\{f>t\\})\\,dt$"
          ],
          "say": "把橫著切寫成公式：非負可測函數的積分，等於從 0 到無限大，對 t 積分 f 大於 t 那個集合的測度。這叫分層公式。",
          "board": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "$f\\ge0$ 可測："
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\int_X f\\,d\\mu=\\int_0^\\infty\\mu(\\{f>t\\})\\,dt}}$",
              "color": "red",
              "on": "等於"
            },
            {
              "do": "box",
              "term": "bx1",
              "color": "red",
              "on": "大於"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "show": [
            "• $t$ 是高度，$\\mu(\\{f>t\\})$ 是那一層的寬度",
            "• $t\\mapsto\\mu(\\{f>t\\})$ 遞減，右邊是普通的一維積分"
          ],
          "say": "t 是高度，f 大於 t 那個集合的測度，就是那一層的寬度。這個寬度隨 t 遞減，所以右邊只是一個普通的一維積分。",
          "board": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "• $t$ 是高度，$\\mu(\\{f>t\\})$ 是那一層的寬度"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "• $t\\mapsto\\mu(\\{f>t\\})$ 遞減，右邊是普通的一維積分",
              "on": "就是"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "　一般 $f$ 的證明要用單調收斂定理（12.52）；下面先證簡單函數",
              "color": "violet",
              "on": "遞減"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "show": [
            "簡單函數的證明：$\\varphi=\\sum_{k=1}^n a_k\\chi_{E_k}$（標準形），$0=a_0<a_1<\\cdots<a_n$"
          ],
          "say": "先證簡單函數。把正的值由小到大排好，a 0 是 0。",
          "board": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "簡單函數的證明：$\\varphi=\\sum_{k=1}^n a_k\\chi_{E_k}$（標準形），$0=a_0<a_1<\\cdots<a_n$"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "show": [
            "$t\\in[a_{i-1},a_i)$：$\\{\\varphi>t\\}=E_i\\cup\\cdots\\cup E_n$",
            "$\\begin{aligned}&\\int_0^\\infty\\mu(\\{\\varphi>t\\})\\,dt\\\\&=\\sum_{i=1}^n(a_i-a_{i-1})\\sum_{k\\ge i}\\mu(E_k)\\end{aligned}$"
          ],
          "say": "t 在相鄰兩個值之間時，斐 大於 t 的點，就是值至少 a i 的那些 E k；寬度是它們的測度和，厚度是兩個值的差。",
          "board": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "$t\\in[a_{i-1},a_i)$：$\\{\\varphi>t\\}=E_i\\cup\\cdots\\cup E_n$"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}&\\int_0^\\infty\\mu(\\{\\varphi>t\\})\\,dt\\\\&=\\sum_{i=1}^n(a_i-a_{i-1})\\sum_{k\\ge i}\\mu(E_k)\\end{aligned}}$",
              "on": "的那"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "show": [
            "交換加總：$\\displaystyle\\sum_k\\mu(E_k)\\sum_{i\\le k}(a_i-a_{i-1})=\\sum_k a_k\\,\\mu(E_k)=\\int\\varphi$　$\\blacksquare$"
          ],
          "say": "交換加總順序，裡面那一串相消，剩下 a k。結果就是 斐 的積分。證明完畢。",
          "board": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "line": "交換加總：$\\displaystyle\\sum_k\\mu(E_k)\\sum_{i\\le k}(a_i-a_{i-1})=\\sum_k a_k\\,\\mu(E_k)=\\int\\varphi$　$\\blacksquare$",
              "color": "gold"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
